 "description": "<p>A kitty suit in nylon mesh: clothing, headdress, bracelet, and stockings in gray, one size for 40-70 kg. The weight range is the widest single-size span in the costume category.</p>\n<p>Nylon-mesh construction makes this the sheerest fabric base on the site - sheerer than chiffon, with more stretch. The headdress and bracelet carry the kitty theme; the stockings arrive matching.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: nylon mesh</li>\n<li>Includes: clothing, headdress, bracelet, stockings</li>\n<li>Style: kitty, sheer</li>\n<li>Color: gray</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, suitable 40-70 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-70 kg, and the mesh stretch backs the claim. Gray is the only colorway, which suits the fabric.</p>\n",
